# Copy to .env.local for development, or set in Vercel → Settings →
# Environment Variables. Everything here is OPTIONAL — the site builds and
# the contact form works without any of it.

# Overrides the Web3Forms access key built into src/lib/contact.ts.
# Only needed to rotate the key or point submissions at a test inbox.
# Get a key at https://web3forms.com by entering the destination address.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
